    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d51-a1">

                <pb facs="0162" n="78" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg78"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 109.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-03-06"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 6,
                        1886</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Denby</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">American Minister, Peking:</hi></p>
                <p>Seymour telegraphs excitement increasing Canton. Hong-Kong papers publish
                    telegrams about President refusing entertain claim indemnity, and Viceroy’s
                    telegram Chinese legation Washington intimating reprisals unless indemnity
                    allowed.</p>
                <closer><signed>SMITHERS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
